@startuml
title riskdep - deciding with a breakeven probability
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EAF6F0
  BorderColor #2E8B67
}
start
:Known incident on a vault
(e.g. collateral marked down 30 %);
:Shock engine on the vault's graph:
loss if the depositor stays;
:Exit queue: loss if it leaves first;
:Cost of leaving now:
yield given up on what can leave;
if (loss saved by leaving first > 0?) then (no)
  :Leaving does not pay,
whatever the odds;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:p* = cost / loss saved;
if (p* >= 1?) then (yes)
  :Stay even if the incident
is certain;
else (no)
  :Leave if the incident is more
likely than p* over the horizon;
endif
:Show the Nexus-implied range
next to p* (never in the verdict);
stop
@enduml
